{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Animated Water from Displacement Maps.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Animated Water from Displacement Maps.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"animated water from displacement maps animated water from displacement maps","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Animated Water from Displacement Maps.md","fileName":"Animated Water from Displacement Maps.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Animated Water from Displacement Maps","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-15 18:17\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Matte Painting and Scene Finishing]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Matte Painting and Scene Finishing","digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Animated Water from Displacement Maps.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Animated Water from Displacement Maps.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"animated water from displacement maps animated water from displacement maps","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Animated Water from Displacement Maps.md","fileName":"Animated Water from Displacement Maps.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Animated Water from Displacement Maps","heading":"Animated Water from Displacement Maps","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Still water in an image can be made to move by displacing a masked copy of the plate with an animated grayscale map. The book constructs wave-like noise with blur, directional blur, contrast adjustment, and scaling to match the pictured ripple pattern. The map drifts slowly in the apparent wave direction; its contrast or the displacement control governs strength. A roto limits the displaced copy to water, while the original still plate remains intact underneath. Large movement breaks the illusion, so subtlety is part of the method.","tags":["baby"],"lin